        "sweeps[*].radials[*].collection_time: a radial's instant is its Modified Julian Date plus its Collection Time, milliseconds past midnight GMT (ICD 2620002Y Table XVII-A); a sweep's observed_at is its last radial's and validity.effective runs from its first to its last",
        "scaled integers: first-gate range and gate interval (thousandths of a km), TOVER (tenths of a dB), SNR threshold (eighths of a dB), ATMOS (thousandths of a dB/km), unambiguous range (tenths of a km) and Nyquist velocity (hundredths of m/s) are stated in their units in the contract; the residual keeps the integers the radial states",
        "derived: the gate codes of every moment of every radial stay in the volume, by reference; the contract states the shape, the packing, a summary whose minimum and maximum are each radial's codes converted with that radial's own scale and offset, and the count of every coded value that is not a measurement, each under its own name",
        "sweeps[*].radials[*].moments[*].name: a moment name the ICD pads to three characters ('SW ') is stated without its trailing space in the contract and in applies_to; the residual keeps the three characters"
